  "description": "These cucumber sandwiches are cool, crisp, refreshing, and...very little more.",
  "notes": "Optional or for serving: 1 1/2 teaspoons fresh dill, optional\n\nNotes: If using cream cheese in this recipe, I recommend using Philadelphia Original Whipped cream cheese. The acidity and tang of the cream cheese pairs well with the mildly flavored cucumber, while the whipped style spreads easily on the bread without tearing it.\nThis recipe can easily be scaled up or down to suit your serving needs.\n\nMake-ahead and storage: The prepared sandwiches can be wrapped tightly with plastic wrap and refrigerated for up to 6 hours.",
